I'll be talking to you once we get to architectures and scaling and all these other very fun things.

12
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,000
I'm really excited. This is the most fun class I've taught in my time here.

13
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
I think every year, you know, Percy makes fun of me because he says,

14
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:14,000
you have to redo all your lectures because you took on architectures and everything changes every time.

15
00:01:14,000 --> 00:01:18,000
But it's actually pretty fun for me to do it. And it's kind of the first time that I've had that experience.

16
