I'm looking forward to going through this experience again with you all.

17
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:29,000
Hello, I'm Marcel. I've CA'd this class once before and I'm returning because it was so much fun last time.

18
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:37,000
It's a lot of work though. In my research, I do architecture stuff, I do higher-order gradients, and I do training.

19
